 of time the dollar will  devalue against them and ultimately  that's the difference between investors  and those who hold no investments it's  an education gap the investors  understand that if i hold assets and not  cash i'm guaranteed to make money  because the dollar will be devalued but  those who have no investable assets  about 45 percent of americans they still  believe that you can save your way to  financial security those are the people  who get screwed in these scenarios  inflation's at a 40-year high there's a  potential recession on the horizon what  you have to do is you have to get  educated you have to understand that  investors win and savers lose and you  have to be prepared because if asset  prices fall in any sort of recessive  period make sure that you're not the  person who's running to something like  the dollar which only is going to get  devalued at a faster rate as the  government tries to stop a recession hey  you did you like this video great we  make five of them a day and post them  here on this channel make sure you  subscribe like the video and see you  next time
 

